                  {
                    "value": "AD-only scope: enabled AD Windows 10 records with unique AD GUID/name and no qualified ID or unique-name match in the current local Intune export. These records are included in the Windows 10 total, not in the Intune-managed KPI.\nAbsence from an export does not prove non-enrollment; an enabled AD account does not prove the PC is active. Country, disk, hardware eligibility and Autopatch state remain unknown when not available. Historical charts remain Intune-only.",
